7dGY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2-w6j2ipwGhetwobQm7UyqlP6NXKJF_z_5YdV7lUpaxg&oe=69F0A62A"}, {"file_name": "3 Point Winner Screen Oculus Store.png", "id": "1095687000936315", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575347_1095687004269648_6352501114012345669_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XE4ikwPejgEQ7kNvwEAojUM&_nc_oc=AdrVnEGMqPdDIE2Li428RFbiUppbYJoDAMVvfU1bGEObqw1AUcwA20ghxV9RdDPCY7U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0etPHQmWltNKG967H88u1vgmug7nHc3QiAO5bHiBUJEw&oe=69F0A4F5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Pickup Basketball VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Pickup Basketball VR is a multiplayer VR game that lets up to 4 players play in various game modes including 1v1, 2v2, Horse and 3-point contest. Pickup Basketball VR allows players to compete online with or against friends and players from across the world.\n\nThis basketball game is an immersive sports gaming experience like never-before utilizing the technology of VR.\n\nPickup Basketball VR utilizes unique technology in allowing  for a never-before experienced simulation of basketball featuring:\n\n- Realistic controls that involve dribbling, shooting, passing that brings you the feel of a true basketball game\n\n- Multiplayer mode where you can play other players online and test your skills in full play pick up games\n\n- Different court options including playground, gym, skyrise and more.\n\n- Customize your player avatar with a variety of options including face, skin tone, hair, jersey and other accessories", "short_description": "Pickup Basketball VR is a multiplayer VR game that lets up to 4 players play in various game modes including 1 v 1, 2 v 2, Horse and 3-point contest. Pickup Basketball VR allows players to compete online with or against friends and players from across the world."}]}, "developer_name": "Revog Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www